flowchart TD
    Start([Purchase Entry Form]) --> SelectSupp[Select Supplier & Inward Details]
    SelectSupp --> InwardLines[Add Line Items: Product, Batch No, Mfg Date, Exp Date, Rate, Qty, Free Qty, GST%]
    InwardLines --> CheckTaxState{Supplier State == Company State?}
    CheckTaxState -->|Same State: 24| IntraTax[Intra-State: CGST 50% + SGST 50%]
    CheckTaxState -->|Different State| InterTax[Inter-State: IGST 100%]
    
    IntraTax --> CalcTotals[Calculate Document Totals & Verify Positive Values]
    InterTax --> CalcTotals
    
    CalcTotals --> StartTx[Start MongoDB Transaction / Session]
    StartTx --> GenPurId[Generate Internal ID: PUR-000001 via idGenerator]
    GenPurId --> BatchUpsert{Batch with productId + batchNo Exists?}
    
    BatchUpsert -->|Yes| UpdateBatch[Accumulate ProductBatch.currentQty += Qty + FreeQty<br/>Update purchaseRate, saleRate, expDate]
    BatchUpsert -->|No| CreateBatch[Create New ProductBatch: BAT-000001<br/>Set initial currentQty = Qty + FreeQty]
    
    UpdateBatch --> RecordMovement[Write StockMovement: type=Purchase, qty=+totalInward]
    CreateBatch --> RecordMovement
    
    RecordMovement --> SyncProduct[Sync Product.currentStock = sum active batches]
    SyncProduct --> PostSuppLedger[Post SupplierLedger: credit=grandTotal, seq++, running balance]
    PostSuppLedger --> SavePurchase[Save Purchase Document with lines]
    SavePurchase --> CommitTx[Commit Transaction]
    CommitTx --> Done[Purchase Saved & Stock Immediately Available for Sale]
